# coversplit — the test packages split from the package they test.
# One `./<split package> ./<package it tests>` per line. A coverage run that
# selects the tested package also runs the split package with
# -coverpkg=<tested package>,<split package> and merges its profile, so the
# tested package keeps the coverage of the tests that moved.
# Read by internal/coversplit (make test-integration, the build floor) and
# pinned by TestEverySplitTestPackageHasItsCoverEntry.
./internal/phases/ship/shiptest ./internal/phases/ship
